Description: NorviOS desktop components and apps for Ubuntu
 Installs the NorviOS desktop for GNOME 50 on Ubuntu 26.04 from the NorviTech
 APT repository: the dock, the workspace bar, the transparent top bar, rounded
 blur, the power-only system menu, the lock screen and wallpaper extensions,
 XNote sticky notes with their placement extension, SnipSnap screenshots and
 the Timecrate backup app.
 .
 The components are recommended rather than required, so any one of them can
 be removed without removing this package, and no version is pinned: each
 component updates on its own. It depends on norvi-archive-keyring, which
 keeps the repository source and its signing key current.
 .
 The boot, login screen and window-glass styling are installed separately,
 from the NorviOS source; the homepage shows how.
